        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Very satisfied with the service here, staff are knowledgeable and helpful.  Prices are reasonable.  Didn't have any weeds in the black earth (basic) they sold me.  Also bought cedar mulch, all good.  Nice local company.",
